record legeos.evidence.home-field-projects-and-zoom/1 : evidence {
    title "Projects1 projects get add-only tiles at the field's right edge; grouping two loose tiles creates a Projects1 project with a stable tile id; clicking a project zooms into its interior grid where tiles move by pointer and keyboard, Backspace moves one back out, Escape returns; the document is unchanged by zoom."
