    summary """
        The record's three remaining gaps closed: per-notification dismiss (a control on every widget row, driving Notifications1.Dismiss for exactly that id); real actions (Notifications1.Invoke validates the key, emits the freedesktop ActionInvoked for the owning application, then closes the notification — with action chips on the Large rung); and push (the shell watches the Changed signal and shows a new arrival as a toast window on Layer::Notification, which the compositor anchors top-right of the usable area, auto-retiring after six seconds, click dismissing that one notification, the startup fetch only setting the watermark). Rows now fill the tile's height instead of a three-line cap. Widget tests drive the real draw with real clicks; the placement rule is tested in lege-window; full just check green.
        """
}

